{"4612390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heroes of Retribution", "steam_appid": 4612390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Redemption is a rogue-like RPG set in a ruined world shrouded in a darkness. Humanity has collapsed, and only heroes like you can save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of tank commander for the established Cleric faction. Patrol the frozen wastelands and fight the demonic infestation. Your first mission is to keep the lamppost burning on the road to the coal mine. This should keep the demons away. Your next task is to retrieve a fresh shipment of coal from the mine and bring it back to town. You'll soon discover that things aren't going according to plan. You'll face much larger problems, and the fate of humanity will rest on your shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMAND A TANK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tank commander, you'll spearhead the Cleric faction's diplomatic efforts. You'll play as a pre-defined character, with more customization options available during Early Access. You will gain experience and grow stronger. Find your own path and become the new hope of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/738da5b562942fb26cacc6ce7b9b9d91.poster.avif?t=1788334124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/738da5b562942fb26cacc6ce7b9b9d91.webm?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/738da5b562942fb26cacc6ce7b9b9d91.mp4?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find other heroes scattered across the world and form the ultimate team. Each hero possesses special abilities and passive skills. Some abilities will offer you a whole new way to play. With each level gained, you will have more choices and the opportunity to unlock new skills. Together, you will become stronger and overcome any obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR TANK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new upgrades for your tank: new types of shells, launchers, and other enhancements that will make you more powerful. Find forgotten relics that, when combined, will strengthen your skills and make you even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/9757f3de41d6794b35e9663d9bfe2199.poster.avif?t=1788334124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/9757f3de41d6794b35e9663d9bfe2199.webm?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/9757f3de41d6794b35e9663d9bfe2199.mp4?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DIVIDED WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the factions and try to unite them around a common goal. Help others or forge your own path. You can choose which factions you will align yourself with as you progress. It's up to you to decide who will become your ally or your enemy. Your choices have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME IS READY AND WILL GROW OVER TIME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story of Heroes of Redemption is complete. During Early Access game has gained new quests, challenges, improvements and polished storylines. New features like barber shop, tank upgrades and skills balance were added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the next months we plan to add more new features for free. Stay tuned for a road map in the next weeks for a sneak peak of what to come. You are welcome to join Discord server to stay in touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/a2633eb2c34179982cb7c8d163171703.poster.avif?t=1788334124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/a2633eb2c34179982cb7c8d163171703.webm?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/a2633eb2c34179982cb7c8d163171703.mp4?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATED BY SMALL STUDIO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Redemption is developed by Tomasz Soroka. Thanks to the support of my family, I was able to bring this project to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Redemption is a rogue-like RPG set in a ruined world shrouded in a darkness. Humanity has collapsed, and only heroes like you can save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of tank commander for the established Cleric faction. Patrol the frozen wastelands and fight the demonic infestation. Your first mission is to keep the lamppost burning on the road to the coal mine. This should keep the demons away. Your next task is to retrieve a fresh shipment of coal from the mine and bring it back to town. You'll soon discover that things aren't going according to plan. You'll face much larger problems, and the fate of humanity will rest on your shoulders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMAND A TANK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As tank commander, you'll spearhead the Cleric faction's diplomatic efforts. You'll play as a pre-defined character, with more customization options available during Early Access. You will gain experience and grow stronger. Find your own path and become the new hope of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/738da5b562942fb26cacc6ce7b9b9d91.poster.avif?t=1788334124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/738da5b562942fb26cacc6ce7b9b9d91.webm?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/738da5b562942fb26cacc6ce7b9b9d91.mp4?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find other heroes scattered across the world and form the ultimate team. Each hero possesses special abilities and passive skills. Some abilities will offer you a whole new way to play. With each level gained, you will have more choices and the opportunity to unlock new skills. Together, you will become stronger and overcome any obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR TANK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new upgrades for your tank: new types of shells, launchers, and other enhancements that will make you more powerful. Find forgotten relics that, when combined, will strengthen your skills and make you even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/9757f3de41d6794b35e9663d9bfe2199.poster.avif?t=1788334124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/9757f3de41d6794b35e9663d9bfe2199.webm?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/9757f3de41d6794b35e9663d9bfe2199.mp4?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DIVIDED WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the factions and try to unite them around a common goal. Help others or forge your own path. You can choose which factions you will align yourself with as you progress. It's up to you to decide who will become your ally or your enemy. Your choices have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME IS READY AND WILL GROW OVER TIME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story of Heroes of Redemption is complete. During Early Access game has gained new quests, challenges, improvements and polished storylines. New features like barber shop, tank upgrades and skills balance were added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the next months we plan to add more new features for free. Stay tuned for a road map in the next weeks for a sneak peak of what to come. You are welcome to join Discord server to stay in touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/a2633eb2c34179982cb7c8d163171703.poster.avif?t=1788334124\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/a2633eb2c34179982cb7c8d163171703.webm?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/extras/a2633eb2c34179982cb7c8d163171703.mp4?t=1788334124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATED BY SMALL STUDIO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes of Redemption is developed by Tomasz Soroka. Thanks to the support of my family, I was able to bring this project to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun</p>", "short_description": "A rogue-like RPG set in a ruined world. Take on the role of a tank commander. Discover other heroes and factions. Upgrade your tank, acquire new skills, and find forgotten relics in this devastated world. Choose your side, get stronger and become humanity's savior.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/51dad1181deba5e038c7b42f71ee8790f026c2ba/header.jpg?t=1788334124", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/e4fb93e66070ffa3f275c6ff3a71fdfe9a0e6226/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788334124", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4612390/e4fb93e66070ffa3f275c6ff3a71fdfe9a0e6226/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788334124", "website": "https://www.heroesofretribution.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660 6GB / RX 5500 XT 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li>